  "$description": "CHIP theme ([data-theme=\"chip\"], 6 Nov 2026, Elleta): overrides on top of semantic/light.json. CHIP's approved colours, a flat blue button, and 16px controls, and shapes: round for what you click, 2px for what holds content. Focus ring stays BELLA's ochre-deep (3.09:1 or more on every CHIP surface). Status pills stay round. border-subtle stays the light value: BELLA also uses it as a fill (nav current, chip hover, score track), so it stays opaque. Everything not listed here is the light value.",
  "typography": {
    "font-family": {
      "display": {
        "$value": "Newsreader, Georgia, serif",
        "$type": "fontFamily",
        "$description": "CHIP titles (Elleta, 7 Nov 2026): the site's title face, this theme only."
